{"title":"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which terms must be removed from the sum\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/8/1d88eebc2f712fed7a59df2ac1567077ea3f97a9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{1}{8}+\\frac{1}{10}+\\frac{1}{12}\\]\" width=\"204\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>if the sum of the remaining terms is to equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/6/e26a3be543b9f846e2b6b4a0100fd65056112ee0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } \\frac{1}{4}\\text{ and }\\frac{1}{8} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }\\frac{1}{4}\\text{ and }\\frac{1}{12} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } \\frac{1}{8}\\text{ and }\\frac{1}{12} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } \\frac{1}{6}\\text{ and }\\frac{1}{10} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }\\frac{1}{8}\\text{ and }\\frac{1}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"651\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We compute the entire sum as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87e194552f413f8d4dc1e34bdea4e6fb6bbe26e4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{1}{8}+\\frac{1}{10}+\\frac{1}{12} &amp;= \\frac{60+30+20+15+12+10}{120} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{147}{120} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{49}{40},\\end{align*}\" width=\"452\" height=\"124\" />\nso the two terms to be removed must sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/7/b67b1f092200e02fd200d982140cf6e1e812be81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{49}{40}-1 = \\frac{9}{40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" />. That is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed40d17898f8722b42d851ff5e5cae9b5e6d5c26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{40} = \\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{y}=\\frac{x+y}{xy}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"169\" height=\"42\" /> for some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/1/cb1ebb34304e493ef084428a6ce3e6af6c60840e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y \\in \\{2,4,6,8,10,12\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"183\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> are coprime, we deduce that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" /> is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> must be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. It follows that one of them must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/9/a692efc1b484cac25479a6d8f22e809156af84ff.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}\\frac{9}{40}-\\frac{1}{10} &amp;= \\frac{9-4}{40} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{5}{40} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{1}{8},\\end{align*}\" width=\"131\" height=\"123\" /> so the two terms we must remove are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/4/d448c2b4172028cfe1e51284926fc3111565cd90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(E)} \\ \\frac{1}{8}\\text{ and }\\frac{1}{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"116\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME\" title=\"1985 AHSME\">1985 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=